                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Peirce to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Peirce reports that the provision, fourth paragraph, second page of the
                    protocol, which is objectionable to the Department, is to be omitted.]</p>
            </div>
